     PRESERVED: JS field order: pactId, staffName, wgGrade, status, classCode, hrsPaid, leave,
                sickSpecial, hrsAvail, available, timeRecorder, startDate, endDate, hoursPerWeek.
     DEFERRED :
       TRANSFORMENGINE TODO: Available? and Time recorder? selects default their selected option
         based on the current Model bool value rendered server-side. Verify FpsViewModelMapper
         ForMember for MakeAvailable (int<->bool) and TimeRecorder (int<->bool) is wired before
         edit mode pre-populates these selects correctly.
       TRANSFORMENGINE TODO: PactId is the record key. In Add mode the user must enter it (JS
